    "text": "The verb 'to be' changes with the person: ମୁଁ … ଅଛି (I am), ତୁମେ … ଅଛ (you are, familiar), ଆପଣ … ଅଛନ୍ତି (you are, polite). Notice Lipi uses ଆପଣ with her uncle, while he uses ତୁମେ with her."
